  "schema:name": "Interview with Yosuke Honjo",
  "schema:description": "Audrey Russek interviewed Yosuke Honjo at the Ritz-Carlton in Half Moon Bay, California, on October 9, 2026. Honjo discusses the founding of his family’s company, ITO EN, the development of ready-to-drink green tea, the company’s expansion into North America, and the future of tea farming in Japan. Russ Kramer, president of Hacienda La Minita, also speaks.",
